<main class="fn-credits-page"><section class="fn-credits-hero"><p class="eyebrow" data-credit="eyebrow">OPEN-SOURCE-KOMPONENTEN UND DANKSAGUNGEN</p><h1>Credits</h1><p data-credit="intro">FabricNavigator baut auf der Arbeit verschiedener Open-Source-Projekte und ihrer Mitwirkenden auf. Diese Seite würdigt die zentralen Komponenten und verweist auf ihre Originalprojekte.</p></section><section class="fn-credit-grid">
<article class="fn-credit-card primary"><span class="fn-credit-mark">ACLI</span><h2>ACLI by Ludovico Stevens</h2><p data-credit="acli">FabricNavigator integriert ACLI (acli.pl) von Ludovico Stevens für die browserbasierten SSH-Sitzungen. Urheberschaft und Anerkennung für ACLI und seine ursprünglichen Komponenten gehören Ludovico Stevens. FabricNavigator beansprucht keine Urheberschaft am ACLI-Projekt.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/lgastevens/ACLI-terminal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/lgastevens/ACLI-terminal</a></p><div class="fn-credit-meta"><span>GNU GPL v3.0</span><span data-credit="fileUpdates">Dateibasierte Updates</span><span>Perl</span></div></article>
<article class="fn-credit-card"><span class="fn-credit-mark">SNMP</span><h2>SNMP4J 2.8.18</h2><p data-credit="snmp4j">SNMP4J von AGENTPP stellt die SNMPv1-, SNMPv2c- und SNMPv3-Kommunikation für Discovery und Geräteinformationen bereit.</p><p><a href="https://www.snmp4j.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">snmp4j.org</a></p><div class="fn-credit-meta"><span>Apache License 2.0</span><span>AGENTPP</span></div></article>
<article class="fn-credit-card"><span class="fn-credit-mark">WEB</span><h2>Apache Tomcat &amp; nginx</h2><p data-credit="webRuntime">Apache Tomcat stellt die Java-Webanwendung bereit; nginx übernimmt den HTTPS-Zugriff und die Reverse-Proxy-Funktionen.</p><p><a href="https://tomcat.apache.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tomcat.apache.org</a> · <a href="https://nginx.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nginx.org</a></p><div class="fn-credit-meta"><span>Apache License 2.0</span><span>BSD-2-Clause</span></div></article>
<article class="fn-credit-card"><span class="fn-credit-mark">TERM</span><h2>xterm.js</h2><p data-credit="xterm">xterm.js stellt die Terminaldarstellung und Tastatureingabe für die browserbasierten SSH-Sitzungen bereit.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js</a></p><div class="fn-credit-meta"><span>MIT License</span><span>Terminal UI</span></div></article>
<article class="fn-credit-card"><span class="fn-credit-mark">RUNTIME</span><h2>OpenJDK, Python &amp; Perl</h2><p data-credit="runtimes">Die Laufzeit verwendet Java/OpenJDK, Python und Perl sowie deren jeweilige Standardbibliotheken für Webserver-, Update-, Proxy- und Terminalfunktionen.</p><p><a href="https://openjdk.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">openjdk.org</a> · <a href="https://www.python.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">python.org</a> · <a href="https://www.perl.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">perl.org</a></p></article>
<article class="fn-credit-card"><span class="fn-credit-mark">IMAGES</span><h2>Extreme Networks device images</h2><p data-credit="images">Optionale Produktbilder und Marken von Extreme Networks bleiben Eigentum ihrer jeweiligen Rechteinhaber und werden getrennt vom FabricNavigator-Kern bereitgestellt.</p><p><a href="https://www.extremenetworks.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">extremenetworks.com</a></p></article>
</section><p class="fn-credits-footer"><span data-credit="footer">Danke an alle Projektverantwortlichen und Mitwirkenden, deren Arbeit FabricNavigator ermöglicht.</span> <strong>FabricNavigator <%=h(version)%></strong></p></main><script src="/assets/app-shell.js?v=20260906-241"></script><script>(function(){var de=(document.documentElement.lang||'de').toLowerCase().indexOf('de')===0;if(de)return;var values={eyebrow:'OPEN-SOURCE COMPONENTS AND ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS',intro:'FabricNavigator builds on the work of several open-source projects and their contributors. This page recognizes the core components and links to their original projects.',acli:'FabricNavigator integrates ACLI (acli.pl) by Ludovico Stevens for browser-based SSH sessions. Authorship and credit for ACLI and its original components belong to Ludovico Stevens. FabricNavigator does not claim authorship of the ACLI project.',fileUpdates:'File-based updates',snmp4j:'SNMP4J by AGENTPP provides SNMPv1, SNMPv2c, and SNMPv3 communication for discovery and device information.',webRuntime:'Apache Tomcat serves the Java web application; nginx provides HTTPS access and reverse-proxy functions.',xterm:'xterm.js provides terminal rendering and keyboard input for browser-based SSH sessions.',runtimes:'The runtime uses Java/OpenJDK, Python, Perl, and their respective standard libraries for web server, update, proxy, and terminal functions.',images:'Optional Extreme Networks product images and trademarks remain the property of their respective rights holders and are distributed separately from the FabricNavigator core.',footer:'Thank you to all project maintainers and contributors whose work makes FabricNavigator possible.'};document.querySelectorAll('[data-credit]').forEach(function(node){var value=values[node.dataset.credit];if(value)node.textContent=value;});}());</script></body></html>
